---
import ProBase from "../layouts/ProBase.astro";
import Topbar from "../components/pro/Topbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/pro/Footer.astro";
import Icon from "../components/pro/Icon.astro";
import { proSite } from "@/lib/proSite";

const title = `${proSite.name} | Resume & Technical CV`;
const description = `Resume and technical CV of ${proSite.name}, 1st Year Undergrad in AI/ML & AIE at Bengaluru, India.`;
---
<ProBase title={title} description={description}>
  <Topbar path="/resume/" />

  <main class="resume-page container">
    <!-- Top Action Toolbar -->
    <div class="resume-toolbar">
      <div class="toolbar-left">
        <a href="/" class="toolbar-btn back-btn">
          <span style="transform: rotate(180deg); display: inline-flex;"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16} stroke={2} /></span>
          <span>Back to Portfolio</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="toolbar-right">
        <button type="button" class="toolbar-btn print-btn" onclick="window.print()">
          <span>🖨️ Print / Save as PDF</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="toolbar-btn copy-text-btn" data-copy-resume>
          <span data-copy-status>📋 Copy Plain Text</span>
        </button>
        <a href={`mailto:${proSite.email}?subject=Interview%20Inquiry%20-%20Siddharth%20Mukherjee`} class="toolbar-btn hire-btn">
          <span>✉️ Contact for Interview</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Printable Resume Document -->
    <article class="resume-paper" id="resumeDoc">
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="resume-header">
        <div class="resume-title-block">
          <h1 class="resume-name">{proSite.name}</h1>
          <p class="resume-headline">B.Tech Student in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning (AI/ML &amp; AIE)</p>
          <p class="resume-meta">
            <span>📍 Bengaluru, Karnataka, India</span>
            <span class="meta-sep">·</span>
            <a href={`mailto:${proSite.email}`}>{proSite.email}</a>
            <span class="meta-sep">·</span>
            <a href="https://github.com/siddharthmukherjeecs-pixel" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/siddharthmukherjeecs-pixel</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-avatar-wrap">
          <img src="/assets/siddharth-avatar.webp" alt={proSite.name} class="resume-avatar-img" />
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Executive Profile -->
      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Executive Profile</h2>
        <p class="section-content">
          Curious and self-motivated first-year undergraduate pursuing a B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning in Bengaluru. 
          Building practical software and AI intuition from Day 1: testing offline local LLM runtimes (Ollama), dissecting vector embeddings and RAG retrieval pipelines, 
          and building high-performance modern web platforms using Astro and TypeScript. Seeking summer internship, research, and mentor-driven engineering opportunities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Education -->
      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech) in AI/ML &amp; AIE</h3>
              <p class="item-subtitle">Engineering Undergraduate · Bengaluru, Karnataka, India</p>
            </div>
            <span class="item-date">2025 – 2029 (Current 1st Year)</span>
          </div>
          <p class="item-desc">
            Core Foundations: Programming in Python, Computer Science Principles, Problem Solving with Algorithms, Linear Algebra &amp; Discrete Mathematics.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technical Capabilities -->
      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Technical Capabilities</h2>
        <div class="skills-table">
          <div class="skill-row">
            <span class="skill-category">AI / ML Tooling</span>
            <span class="skill-list">Local LLMs (Ollama, Llama 3.2 3B, Mistral 7B), RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation), nomic-embed-text (384-dim), ChromaDB, Cosine Semantic Similarity, Quantization (Q4_K_M).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-row">
            <span class="skill-category">Languages</span>
            <span class="skill-list">Python 3 (NumPy, standard library), TypeScript, JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, CSS3 / Modern CSS Clamp.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-row">
            <span class="skill-category">Web &amp; Frameworks</span>
            <span class="skill-list">Astro 7.3, Svelte, React, WebGL Liquid Cylinder Shaders, Keystatic Headless CMS, Vite, Responsive Architecture.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-row">
            <span class="skill-category">Systems &amp; DevOps</span>
            <span class="skill-list">macOS / Linux Terminal (zsh), Git &amp; GitHub, Vercel CI/CD, pnpm, Sharp Image Processing Engine.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Featured Engineering Projects -->
      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Featured Technical Projects</h2>

        <!-- Project 1 -->
        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">Local LLM Benchmarking &amp; Offline Inference</h3>
              <p class="item-subtitle">Personal Exploration · AI / Local Compute</p>
            </div>
            <span class="item-date">2026 · Active</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="item-bullets">
            <li>Deployed and tested quantized open-weights models (Llama 3.2 3B and Mistral 7B) locally on personal hardware via Ollama CLI.</li>
            <li>Evaluated token generation throughput (~42 tps for 3B) and first-token response latency to understand consumer hardware limits.</li>
            <li>Tested custom system prompts to configure the local model as an offline study assistant with zero cloud data transmission.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2 -->
        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Architecture Study</h3>
              <p class="item-subtitle">Self-Study &amp; Implementation · Python &amp; Vector Embeddings</p>
            </div>
            <span class="item-date">2026 · Active</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="item-bullets">
            <li>Implemented cosine similarity matrix calculations from scratch in Python with NumPy to understand vector distance mechanics.</li>
            <li>Designed a multi-stage RAG workflow: raw Markdown/PDF chunking (500 tokens, 50 overlap), embedding via <code>nomic-embed-text</code>, and ChromaDB vector retrieval.</li>
            <li>Demonstrated top-k similarity context injection into prompt windows to eliminate model hallucinations on custom engineering notes.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 3 -->
        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">High-Performance Personal Digital Space &amp; Portfolio</h3>
              <p class="item-subtitle">Modern Web Engineering · Astro 7.3, TypeScript, WebGL</p>
            </div>
            <span class="item-date">2026 · Completed</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="item-bullets">
            <li>Engineered a dual-experience website combining a clean professional showcase with a casual digital garden/blog using Astro 7.3.</li>
            <li>Integrated custom WebGL shaders for liquid cylinder carousel effects and mathematical golden-angle 3D orbit gallery animations.</li>
            <li>Integrated Keystatic headless CMS for declarative content management with zero build errors and strict TypeScript safety.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 4 -->
        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div>
              <h3 class="item-title">Python Foundations &amp; Algorithmic Problem Solving</h3>
              <p class="item-subtitle">Programming Logic · First-Year Computer Science</p>
            </div>
            <span class="item-date">2026 · Ongoing</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="item-bullets">
            <li>Developed modular Python scripts practicing algorithmic recursion, matrix multiplication, list comprehensions, and data structures.</li>
            <li>Built automated unit test suites verifying algorithm correctness and maintaining clean code standards.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Mindset & Work Ethic -->
      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Engineering Mindset &amp; Values</h2>
        <div class="values-grid">
          <div class="value-card">
            <strong>Curious Above All:</strong> Stays hungry to understand low-level details rather than treating frameworks as black boxes.
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <strong>Learn by Breaking Things:</strong> Inspects tracebacks and debugs root causes to build enduring technical intuition.
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <strong>Simplicity First:</strong> Writes clean, readable, modular code with descriptive naming and strict typing over clever complexity.
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <strong>Humble Learner:</strong> Transparent about being a 1st-year student; highly receptive to code reviews, critique, and team guidance.
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</ProBase>

<style>
.resume-page {
  padding-top: 100px;
  padding-bottom: 80px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 24px;
}
.resume-toolbar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 12px 0;
}
.toolbar-left, .toolbar-right {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
}
.toolbar-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-family: var(--font, sans-serif);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  color: var(--white);
}
.toolbar-btn:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}
.toolbar-btn.hire-btn {
  background: #38bdf8;
  color: #030712;
  border-color: #38bdf8;
}
.toolbar-btn.hire-btn:hover {
  background: #7dd3fc;
  box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
}
.toolbar-btn.print-btn {
  background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
  border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
  color: #38bdf8;
}

/* The Paper Card */
.resume-paper {
  background: #0f141f;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 48px;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 32px;
  color: #e2e8f0;
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .resume-paper {
    padding: 24px;
    gap: 24px;
  }
}

/* Header */
.resume-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  padding-bottom: 28px;
}
.resume-title-block {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
}
.resume-name {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 36px);
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #ffffff;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 0;
}
.resume-headline {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #38bdf8;
  margin: 0;
}
.resume-meta {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #94a3b8;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin: 4px 0 0;
}
.resume-meta a {
  color: #94a3b8;
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-decoration-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
}
.resume-meta a:hover {
  color: #38bdf8;
}
.meta-sep {
  color: #475569;
}
.resume-avatar-wrap {
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.resume-avatar-img {
  width: 90px;
  height: 90px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  border: 2px solid #38bdf8;
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
}
@media (max-width: 500px) {
  .resume-avatar-wrap {
    display: none;
  }
}

/* Sections */
.resume-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 14px;
}
.section-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  color: #38bdf8;
  margin: 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
  padding-bottom: 6px;
}
.section-content {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: #cbd5e1;
  margin: 0;
}

/* Items */
.resume-item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.item-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 4px;
}
.item-title {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #ffffff;
  margin: 0;
}
.item-subtitle {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #94a3b8;
  margin: 2px 0 0;
}
.item-date {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
  color: #64748b;
}
.item-desc {
  font-size: 13.5px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: #cbd5e1;
  margin: 0;
}
.item-bullets {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 20px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}
.item-bullets li {
  font-size: 13.5px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: #cbd5e1;
}
.item-bullets code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
  font-size: 12px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  padding: 2px 6px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  color: #38bdf8;
}

/* Skills Table */
.skills-table {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}
.skill-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  font-size: 13.5px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .skill-row {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 4px;
  }
}
.skill-category {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #94a3b8;
}
.skill-list {
  color: #f1f5f9;
}

/* Values Grid */
.values-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .values-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
.value-card {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #cbd5e1;
}
.value-card strong {
  color: #f1f5f9;
}

/* ================= PRINT STYLES ================= */
@media print {
  /* Hide non-printable UI elements */
  .topbar, .footer, .resume-toolbar, #interviewerDossier {
    display: none !important;
  }
  body, html {
    background: #ffffff !important;
    color: #000000 !important;
  }
  .resume-page {
    padding: 0 !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
  }
  .resume-paper {
    background: #ffffff !important;
    border: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    color: #111827 !important;
    gap: 20px !important;
  }
  .resume-name {
    color: #000000 !important;
    font-size: 24pt !important;
  }
  .resume-headline {
    color: #1e40af !important;
    font-size: 12pt !important;
  }
  .resume-meta, .resume-meta a {
    color: #4b5563 !important;
    font-size: 9.5pt !important;
  }
  .section-title {
    color: #1e3a8a !important;
    border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #1e3a8a !important;
    font-size: 11pt !important;
  }
  .item-title {
    color: #000000 !important;
    font-size: 11pt !important;
  }
  .item-subtitle, .item-date, .skill-category {
    color: #4b5563 !important;
  }
  .section-content, .item-desc, .item-bullets li, .skill-list, .value-card {
    color: #1f2937 !important;
    font-size: 10pt !important;
  }
  .resume-header {
    border-bottom: 1pt solid #cbd5e1 !important;
  }
  .value-card {
    border: 1pt solid #e5e7eb !important;
    background: #f9fafb !important;
  }
  .item-bullets code {
    background: #f3f4f6 !important;
    color: #1f2937 !important;
  }
}
</style>

<script>
  function setupResume() {
    const copyBtn = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-copy-resume]");
    if (!copyBtn) return;

    copyBtn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      const text = `
SIDDHARTH MUKHERJEE
B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning (AI/ML & AIE) · Class of 2029
Location: Bengaluru, Karnataka, India
Email: siddharthmukherjee.cs@gmail.com
GitHub: https://github.com/siddharthmukherjeecs-pixel

EXECUTIVE PROFILE:
First-year engineering student in Bengaluru building software and AI intuition hands-on from Day 1. Active with local LLM orchestration via Ollama, vector embeddings & RAG retrieval systems, and modern web engineering with Astro and TypeScript. Seeking summer internship and student research opportunities.

EDUCATION:
Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech) in AI/ML & AIE (2025–2029, Year 1)
Bengaluru, Karnataka, India
Core: Programming in Python, Computer Science Foundations, Linear Algebra, Problem Solving.

TECHNICAL SKILLS:
- AI & ML: Ollama, Llama 3.2 (3B), Mistral (7B), RAG, nomic-embed-text, ChromaDB, Cosine Similarity, Quantization (Q4_K_M).
- Languages: Python 3 (NumPy), TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML5/CSS3.
- Web & Systems: Astro 7.3, Svelte, React, WebGL, Keystatic CMS, Git, macOS/Linux CLI, Vercel.

KEY PROJECTS:
1. Local LLM Benchmarking & Offline Inference: Ran quantized models offline on personal hardware with Ollama; measured latency & ~42 tps throughput.
2. Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Architecture Study: Implemented cosine similarity in Python with NumPy; designed 384-dim chunking and ChromaDB retrieval.
3. High-Performance Digital Space: Built responsive dual-experience platform using Astro 7.3, TypeScript, and WebGL liquid cylinder shaders.
4. Python Foundations & Problem Solving: Built modular Python scripts practicing algorithmic logic, recursion, and data structures with automated unit tests.
      `.trim();

      const statusEl = copyBtn.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-copy-status]");
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
        if (statusEl) statusEl.textContent = "✔ Plain Text Copied!";
        setTimeout(() => {
          if (statusEl) statusEl.textContent = "📋 Copy Plain Text";
        }, 2500);
      } catch {
        if (statusEl) statusEl.textContent = "Failed to copy";
      }
    });
  }

  setupResume();
  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", setupResume);
</script>
